E, INDIANA TODAY ANNOUNCED A $4.4 MILLION PROJECT WITH AT&T* TO BUILD ITS STATE-OF-THE-ART FIBER NETWORK TO MORE THAN 4,000 CUSTOMER LOCATIONS THROUGHOUT THE CITY.'}{'symbol': 'TECH', 'date': '2022-05-12 07:00:00', 'title': "BIO-TECHNE AND NONAGEN BIOSCIENCE ANNOUNCE EXCLUSIVE SUPPLY AGREEMENT FOR NONAGEN'S ONCURIA® BLADDER CANCER TEST", 'text': "MINNEAPOLIS AND LOS ANGELES, MAY 12, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0BIO-TECHNE CORPORATION (NASDAQ: TECH) AND NONAGEN BIOSCIENCE \xa0TODAY ANNOUNCED AN AGREEMENT FOR R&D SYSTEMS, A BIO-TECHNE BRAND, TO EXCLUSIVELY MANUFACTURE NONAGEN BIOSCIENCE'S ONCURIA® BLADDER CANCER DIAGNOSTIC PANEL USING XMAP LUMINEX® TECHNOLOGY. ONCURIA IS THE FIRST-OF-ITS-KIND MULTIPLEX PROTEIN-BASED URINE TEST TO PROVIDE EARLY AND ACCURATE DETECTION, THERAPY CHOICE, AND DISEASE MONITORING OF BLADDER CANCER."}{'symbol': 'BR', 'date': '2022-05-12 09:10:00', 'title': 'BROADRIDGE DECLARES QUARTERLY DIVIDEND OF $0.64 PER SHARE', 'text': 'NEW YORK , MAY 12, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0BROADRIDGE FINANCIAL SOLUTIONS, INC. (NYSE:BR)\xa0ANNOUNCED THAT ITS BOARD OF DIRECTORS HAS DECLARED A QUARTERLY CASH DIVIDEND OF\xa0$0.64 PER SHARE. THE DIVIDEND IS PAYABLE ON JULY 6, 2022 TO STOCKHOLDERS OF RECORD AT THE CLOSE OF BUSINESS ON JUNE 15, 2022.'}{'symbol': 'CBOE', 'date': '2022-05-12 16:30:00', 'title': 'CBOE GLOBAL MARKETS DECLARES SECOND-QUARTER 2022 DIVIDEND', 'text': 'CHICAGO , MAY 12, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- CBOE GLOBAL MARKETS, INC. (CBOE: CBOE), A LEADING PROVIDER OF GLOBAL MARKET INFRASTRUCTURE AND TRADABLE PRODUCTS, TODAY ANNOUNCED ITS BOARD OF DIRECTORS HAS DECLARED A QUARTERLY CASH DIVIDEND OF $0.48 PER SHARE OF COMMON STOCK FOR THE SECOND QUARTER OF 2022. THE SECOND-QUARTER 2022 DIVIDEND IS PAYABLE ON JUNE 15, 2022, TO STOCKHOLDERS OF RECORD AS OF MAY 31, 2022.'}{'symbol': 'CBOE', 'date': '2022-05-12 14:13:00', 'title': 'CBOE GLOBAL MARKETS ANNOUNCES 2022 ANNUAL MEETING RESULTS', 'text': 'CHICAGO , MAY 12, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- CBOE GLOBAL MARKETS, INC. (CBOE: CBO